  'totalNumberPages define o total de folhas. O controller expõe increasePage(), decreasePage() e page().': <String>['totalNumberPages sets the total number of sheets. The controller exposes increasePage(), decreasePage() and page().', 'totalNumberPages define o total de folhas. O controller expõe increasePage(), decreasePage() e page().', 'totalNumberPages define el total de hojas. El controller expone increasePage(), decreasePage() y page().', 'totalNumberPages définit le nombre total de feuilles. Le controller expose increasePage(), decreasePage() et page().'],
  'totalNumberPages faz a pilha encolher a cada increasePage(); decreasePage() traz a folha de volta por baixo.': <String>['totalNumberPages makes the pile shrink on each increasePage(); decreasePage() brings the sheet back from below.', 'totalNumberPages faz a pilha encolher a cada increasePage(); decreasePage() traz a folha de volta por baixo.', 'totalNumberPages hace que la pila se reduzca en cada increasePage(); decreasePage() trae la hoja de vuelta por debajo.', 'totalNumberPages réduit la pile à chaque increasePage() ; decreasePage() ramène la feuille par le dessous.'],
